<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_paragraph">SFT.</h5>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We summarize our shared SFT and Action-aware SFT implementation parameters in Table <a href="#A2.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ SFT. ‣ Appendix B Implementation Details ‣ GUI-Libra: Training Native GUI Agents to Reason and Act with Action-aware Supervision and Partially Verifiable RL" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>. We apply full parameter tuning on Qwen2.5-VL and Qwen3-VL base models from 3B,4B, to 7B and 8B. We use a learning rate of <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\times 10^{-5}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\times 10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math> and an effective batch size of 256. We train SFT and ASFT models for either two epochs on GUI-Libra-81K or 1 epoch on mixing reasoning and direct-action data (it doubles data size). For action-aware SFT, we by default use <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{a}=2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{a}=2</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{g}=4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{g}=4</annotation></semantics></math> for ASFT, except for GUI-Libra-4B, where <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha_{a}=\alpha_{g}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha_{a}=\alpha_{g}=1</annotation></semantics></math>. We use 8 B200 GPUs for approximately 4 hours for Qwen3-VL-4B and 5.5 hours for Qwen3-VL-8B.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T13" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T13.3" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T13.3.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T13.3.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A2.T13.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Category</span></td>
<td id="A2.T13.3.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A2.T13.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Configuration</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T13.3.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T13.3.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.7pt;padding-bottom:0.7pt;"><span id="A2.T13.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Backbone</span></td>
